{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_921.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f3addb9b2d29750b50e8b064a9cf185d8b8360b6c4afd50f32f010a246a31c57","ja":"どうしたの、雪歩ちゃん？\nため息なんてついて。何か心配事？","zh":"怎么了，雪步？\n一直叹气，是有什么烦心事吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_921.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"78558d8c597c4f019f4568a4c76db9d8440c41c6f72d270c64277cb2e954a1db","ja":"琴葉ちゃん……。あのね、今度、ツアーの宣伝で\nお仕事するでしょ？　それでちょっと困ってて……。","zh":"琴叶……那个，之后要为巡演做宣传工作，对吧？所以我有点为难……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_921.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3215f0f9f3898af4da6a2579432aa1e936f27b385b0b8d8b213f12de3cdd6e94","ja":"お仕事って、動物番組のゲストのこと？\nそっか、雪歩ちゃんは犬が苦手だったよね。","zh":"工作是指担任动物节目的嘉宾吗？\n这样啊，雪步不太擅长应付狗狗呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_921.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b99f78666b4bd1644a26c7a393570dcb8fb12f157b0439bb21196622e9c2e090","ja":"うん……。それに『ワンちゃんと触れ合いタイム』って\n台本に書いてあって……。私、もうダメかも～！","zh":"嗯……而且剧本上还写着“和狗狗亲密接触时间”……我可能真的不行了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_921.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"be5188ef296d42308615ecd20f575faf7016b9a1a7fad6890f1b1b28e201daad","ja":"話は聞かせてもらったよ、ゆきぴょん！\nこうなったら、コクフクするしかないっしょ♪","zh":"我已经听说了，雪步！\n既然这样，就只能去告白了吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_921.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ad8f75d9e0586db0b36b53f5694895a1149dec2f87e7f5cfba3b0765418e7dc9","ja":"わっ、真美ちゃん！？\n……えっと、克服って？","zh":"哇，真美！？\n……那个，克服是指？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_921.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"325d336708a6537ac65444ba5f24b776c4ebe396d5e8d25be12e9a9e2e8e78de","ja":"知ってる？　駅前にドッグカフェができたんだって！\n真美、一度行ってみたかったんだ～♪","zh":"知道吗？听说车站前开了一家狗狗咖啡馆！\n真美一直想去看看呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_921.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d41f817e41cfab0ac40718d2ad94e2c361ba34a9e56545e61230c0302b43d5a6","ja":"たしか、子犬しかいないんだよね？\n雪歩ちゃんの特訓にはピッタリかも。","zh":"确实，里面只有小狗吧？\n或许非常适合雪步的特训。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_921.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"75649a1e0fe8f2cc574a4b6c76470d0fddd391dc34e49ecae20105e32759c734","ja":"子犬……。ちっちゃくても犬は犬だよ……ううっ……。\nでもでも、こうやって逃げてるからダメなんだよね。","zh":"小狗……再小也是狗啊……呜呜……不过不过，像这样一直逃避是不行的呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_921.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"c7bfad27d0e79976ca9cde8885e63eb25e3bb13927ddadc77b44051b5c900e02","ja":"……わ、わかった！　\n私、ドッグカフェに挑戦してみるっ！","zh":"……好、好吧！\n我要挑战一下狗狗咖啡厅！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
